<title>USA: Johnson Worldwide names Whitaker CEO.</title>
<headline>Johnson Worldwide names Whitaker CEO.</headline>
<dateline>RACINE, Wis. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Johnson Worldwide Associates Inc said Wednesday it named Ronald Whitaker as president and chief executive officer, effective October 21.</p>
<p>Whitaker succeeds John Crabb, who resigned in late June.  </p>
<p>Most recently, Whitaker was president and chief executive officer of EWI Inc, a supplier to the automotive industry.</p>
<p>Johnson Worldwide designs and manufactures outdoor recreation products.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
